// Generated by the sprint-16..19 frontend split (see docs/refactor_2026-09/sprints.md).
// Ported near-verbatim from harmonia_min/app_shell.html's single <script> — see that
// file's own top-of-script comment for the app's history. Behaviour is unchanged;
